{
  "id": "poem-d06908cc0799577bfe94d379",
  "title": "荷叶鱼儿",
  "author": "柯丹邱《荆钗记》",
  "dynasty": "元",
  "verses": [
    "［外上］春雨新收，喜见山明水秀，万花深处有鸣鸠，软红泥踏青时候。",
    "试蹑青鞋，慢拖斑竹，去寻良友。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "元曲选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/元曲/yuanqu.json#record-8048",
